                "Once there was a little garden where every flower knew the name of its neighbor.",
                "A kind old woman planted seeds every spring, and by summer her yard was a rainbow of colors.",
                "There was once a cat who lived in a library and would curl up next to whoever needed comfort most.",
                "A grandmother baked bread every Sunday. The whole street smelled of warmth and home.",
