            ).random() else listOf(
                "I understand — that's very uncomfortable. Try to drink some water, which often helps. And please do mention it to your caregiver or doctor — they know what to do.",
                "This is very common and easily helped with the right care. Please let your caregiver or a family member know — they can help sort it out.",
                "I hear you. Sip some water and please mention this to your helper today. This can be treated — you don't need to just put up with it."
